  "review": {
    "kind": "structure",
    "description": "S1-S6 exact question identity, explicit approvals and independent execution/report state retain their behavior; impact follows shared configuration and UI mappings.",
    "implementation": "The added dynamic inspect_configuration result changes no answer/report_status dispatch or request/epoch binding. Structured configuration communication keeps once-only answers and strict nonempty validation; accounting has no question payload or confirmation authority.",
    "tests": "TestStatusToolBlockingAndNativeAnswers rejects invalid blocked status, suspends the valid native response, blocks ordinary chat, delivers one answer and rejects duplicates. Configuration communication rejects empty/blank/confirm-only answers, answers only the original question and leaves proposals proposed; expired questions cannot accept answers. Accounting inspection asserts no turn/start or write."
  },
